    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70324" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεο-πενθής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in new sorrow,
				fresh-mourning,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεοπενθέα θυμὸν ἔχουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>lately mourned,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεοπενθὴς ᾤχετ᾽ ἐς Ἅιδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(7).447.6
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.1663
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
